 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "By the end of it, you should have a solid foundation to build upon as you progress in your career.",
  "Now, one of the things we do here at DEVS is ensure that all our engineers are set up with a Linux desktop as their main machine.",
  "It provides a consistent development environment for everyone and makes collaboration easier.",
  "So, I want you to start using a Linux desktop as your primary computer from now on.",
  "End all function argument names with '_h'.",
  "Consistency is key in software engineering, and it's important that we all follow the same standards.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if there's anything at all that you need.",
  "When faced with connectivity problems, it's important to systematic in your approach.",
  "Don't underestimate the power of a simple ping test to isolate issues.",
  "Also, remember that log files can provide valuable insights.",
  "From now on, when ending function argument names, always append the suffix '_e'.",
  "This helps us maintain a clear and distinguishable naming convention.\"",
  "If you have any questions or need further clarification on anything we've discussed, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "I'm here to support you and ensure your success.\"",
  "Now, as an engineer, your role in this process is crucial.",
  "First, actively engage with your colleagues, especially those who might be considering moving on.",
  "Show genuine interest in their experiences and be open to any feedback they're willing to share."
 ],
